{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_05_beg","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_05","title":"拙山","storyCode":"WR-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0120b4a0713d92fcc08d10ab48aa3f0040d1fe850e43111a9991d6c5050621d6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......那位女性叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"也不敢呐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"再說那如夢似幻，如真似假，興許是一年半載，又或是彈指一瞬，恍神之間，這上哪兒問去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧遊歷炎國，有意無意回想起這個故事，細細想來，興許只是住持爺爺敷衍我而胡亂編的故事罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不過小僧在炎國四處打聽，這幅《拙山盡起圖》竟然還小有名氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"相傳是一位約百年前的無名畫家所留，曾有皇親國戚重金求而不得，因此聞名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧到了灰齊山附近，小僧便突發奇想，想借機去看看是否能找到那畫中的奇景......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，在山中尋到一處山清水秀之地，反應過來時，就已經身在此處啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"灰齊山上的那棟茅屋，這倒是和我們如出一轍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡會是一場夢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"如是一場大夢，那對施主來說，小僧便是夢中幻象，那小僧說的話，也就不可信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"若是不可信了，炎熔施主又如何判斷眼前的景色，是夢非夢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"慢點......你要把我繞暈了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道怎麼離開這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧雲遊至今，仍未明白如何主動離開此地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......至今？你在這裡待了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"很久很久啦，細細數來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"二位的茶就要涼了，別光顧著說話，品一品茶吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？說起來，黎小姐，難道也是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"只是本地的當鋪掌櫃罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔小姐......我很欣賞你的善良，也很欽佩你從墨魎手下保護鎮民的意願，但有時候，請多考慮一下自己的安危。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那些怪物對羅德島的精銳構不成威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"此話不假，炎熔施主一身好本領，無需擔心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......若真是如此，也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔小姐，我有一個問題，不知當不當問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"問吧，其實不用對我們這麼拘謹的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔小姐，你可端詳過水中的月亮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"無論水中月色會被粼粼波光扯碎成什麼模樣，待到風平浪靜時，它還會是那輪圓月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"若是因為憐憫那一時閃爍的水中月色，因此濕了鞋，著了涼，是大沒有必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔小姐，你可會為了撈那一輪水中月......費盡心思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不......應該不會？做這種事沒什麼意義吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然說這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知炎熔小姐的那輪明月是何模樣，也就無法提醒炎熔小姐到底差在何處。不過水中月，終歸是水中月罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要為了我們，做到這個份上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人！恩人！你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊呀，連茶都泡了，居然不喊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"這二位想必也是婆山鎮的貴客吧？我去泡茶，順路拿些糕點，你們慢敘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"那位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是這裡的掌櫃，名字叫黎，黎明的黎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，那些墨魎呢？哦哦，我知道了！一定是恩人神威無敵，把它們全都趕跑啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"——那個小女孩安全了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"她安全了，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚，恩人呐，你怎麼如此不信任我......我走過刀山火海也未流淚的，現在倒是有幾分心酸......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"二位，茶水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯......聞著就感覺到是很昂貴的茶葉呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人好見識！像我這種凡夫俗子，只覺得苦，完全嘗不出滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"只是尋常茶葉罷了。鎮上集市，只有賣這一種茶葉，若是不合意，還請見諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊~雖然習慣了紅茶和咖啡，但是偶爾品一品大炎的茶葉，也別有一番滋味嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧家鄉也有堪稱別具滋味的茶葉，若是有機會，請務必讓小僧小露一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，小炎熔，你想睡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。只是突然放鬆下來罷了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"茶水養心，幾位勞煩的事情，不是靠奔波勞累就能解決的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......還是沒什麼線索啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"在這畫中天地，只能慢慢來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"對了！嵯峨，你見過這個東西嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧並不知曉......只是不知為何，小僧總覺得曾在某地見過此物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"真的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"待小僧想想......唔......這個紋理......此般材質......究竟是在何時何地見識過呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"茶水反射的光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦哦！？發生什麼了？怎麼突然都站起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"天亮了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這些東西怎麼靠近這裡的！？這裡可是午時街啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不對，天邊......太陽怎、怎跑到那邊去了？鴻洞山發生了什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！這些東西，在，在吃人——！快跑，快跑啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......逝者如斯夫，日升月落，理當如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......擾吾清靜......是她的意思？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......這、這是什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼太陽會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"——太陽本來就該這樣哦，小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，這我當然知道啊，我只是在想怎麼突然恢復正常了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，對啊，這才是正常的......我剛才是怎麼想的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"二位恩人，我怎麼覺得鎮子那方向，這麼熱鬧呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"救命——救命！救——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事吧！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我沒事，原來你們在這兒，真是太好了，太好了！那些怪物突然不怕陽光啦!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"它們正在鎮子上，吃、吃、吃......吃人啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["烏有"]}]}
